v}^{′}‖ & =‖⟨-6u,\\,2,\\,-6u⟩‖ \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-6u)^{2}+(2)^{2}+(-6u)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{36{u}^{2}+4+36{u}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{72{u}^{2}+4} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4(18{u}^{2}+1)} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{18{u}^{2}+1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface area is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}2\\sqrt{18{u}^{2}+1}\\,\\text{d}A\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397971 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397972 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397971 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397973 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397971 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397974 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397971 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397975 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397971 1075 #edb/ref 17592186397976 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397971 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397971 1077 "selection" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397971 1079 #edb/ref 17592186397975 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397971 1080 #uuid "96083256-eb07-5ebd-a86e-e5865f463363" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397972 1081 "\\sqrt{{u}^{2}+4}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397972 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397972 1084 #uuid "5545b0b7-751d-5798-9bd4-dfa8faf23f03" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397973 1081 "2u\\sqrt{9{u}^{2}+1}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397973 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397973 1084 #uuid "a470c598-2c0a-5ceb-ac0e-1fb73e235141" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397974 1081 "2\\sqrt{{u}^{2}+1}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397974 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397974 1084 #uuid "dade9321-241a-5817-902c-2195520cffda" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186397975 1