$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $x$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int (9-5x)^{-3}\\text{d}x & =\\int {u}^{-3}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{5})\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{5}\\int {u}^{-3}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{5}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2}){u}^{-2}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10{u}^{2}}+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10(9-5x)^{2}}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{1}{10(9-5x)^{2}}+C] & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[\\frac{1}{10(9-5x)^{2}}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[(9-5x)^{-2}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{10}\\cdot (-2)(9-5x)^{-3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(9-5x)+0 \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{5}(9-5x)^{-3}\\cdot (-5) \\\\  & =(9-5x)^{-3} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{(9-5x)}^{3}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398123 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398124 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398123 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398125 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398123 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398126 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398123 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398127 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398123 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398128 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398123 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398123 1077 "selection" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398123 1079 #edb/ref 17592186398127 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398123 1080 #uuid "3b49b60e-8217-5844-bea9-fe48c12aaf25" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398124 1081 "\\frac{1}{20(9-5x)^{4}}+C" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398124 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398124 1084 #uuid "06f0d601-5b9e-5b34-b1e4-35332