\\cdot \\text{d}S={∬}_{D}\\boxed{}\\,\\text{d}A\n$$\n\nwhat is the missing expression?\n\n*Hint: You can use the fact that ${r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}=⟨-2{u}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡v,\\,-2{u}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡v,\\,u⟩.$*" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398513 1072 #uuid "50f21d4c-115f-5f6b-a6fe-50fa77f7169e" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398513 1074 "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the flux of a vector field $F$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S={∬}_{S}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nNotice we are told that the fundamental vector product for our surface is\n\n$$\n{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}=⟨-2{u}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡v,\\,-2{u}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡v,\\,u⟩.\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the coordinate expressions of $r(u,v)$ into $F(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(u,v)) & =⟨3x,\\,3y,\\,z⟩{|}_{x=u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v\\,y=u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\\,z={u}^{2}} \\\\  & =⟨3u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v,\\,3u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v,\\,{u}^{2}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the dot product of $F$ and ${r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}) & =⟨3u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v,\\,3u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v,\\,{u}^{2}⟩\\cdot ⟨-2{u}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡v,\\,-2{u}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡v,\\,u⟩ \\\\  & =3u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v\\cdot (-2{u}^{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡v)+3u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\\cdot (-2{u}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡v)+{u}^{2}\\cdot u \\\\  & =-6{u}^{3}({cos}^{2}⁡v+{sin}^{2}⁡v)+{u}^{3} \\\\  & =-5{u}^{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,-5{u}^{3}\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398514 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398515 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398514 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398516 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398514 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398517 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398514 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398518 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398514 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398519 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398514 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398514 1077 "selection" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398514 1079 #edb/ref 17592186398518 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398514 1080 #uuid "f48bed04-e645-581d-90b2-d43b8caed324" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398515 1081 "6{u}^{3}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398515 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398515 1084 #uuid "4d89472a-c8a6-58ee-ad06-702bb85242bc" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398516 1081 "{u}^{3}\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\\operatorname{cos}⁡v" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398516 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398516 1084 #uuid "6ceed292-fdb3-5c81-a5ef-e21d4577bafc" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398517 1081 "2{u}^{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\\operatorname{cos}⁡v" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398517 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398517 1084 #uuid "2e773ddf-4b3c-5bc1-b538-c1702b36529f" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398518 1081 "-5{u}^{3}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398518 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398518 1084 #uuid "06d6268a-1fe9-5430-934f-527eb0153af9" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398519 1081 "-3{u}^{2}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398519 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398519 1084 #uuid "c1b5545b-f437-5265-821f-6ea217aea603" 131941395334