u(-t).$\n\n- Next, we shift by two units to the right, giving $y=u(-(t-2))=u(2-t).$\n\n- Finally, we scale by a scale factor of $2$ parallel to the $y$-axis, giving $y=2u(2-t).$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that $f(t)=2u(2-t).$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398733 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398734 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398733 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398735 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398733 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398736 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398733 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398737 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398733 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398738 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398733 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398733 1077 "selection" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398733 1079 #edb/ref 17592186398736 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398733 1080 #uuid "b3cea1da-caf8-5a92-9bda-36ca6d40d488" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398734 1081 "u(2-t)" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398734 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398734 1084 #uuid "ef6a3348-180d-5a52-84e9-a96997f731ba" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398735 1081 "2u(-2-t)" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398735 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398735 1084 #uuid "820cc08e-5f42-588a-978c-05235747eeed" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398736 1081 "2u(2-t)" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398736 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398736 1084 #uuid "aa32bc9f-c781-5288-a4ef-fb4854e7d6c5" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398737 1081 "2u(t-2)" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398737 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398737 1084 #uuid "cdb21f80-453e-52bf-96ac-d7a84cef123e" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398738 1081 "2u(2-t)+1" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398738 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398738 1084 #uuid "cd2cca3d-1e5f-5be6-8837-3a96952aa51e" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398739 1068 #edb/ref 17592186398740 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398739 1069 "q-331457" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398739 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398739 1071 "Find the Laplace transform of $f(t)={e}^{3t}-{e}^{-t}$ for $s>3.$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398739 1072 #uuid "fde1c354-d593-5da3-9167-ee1bf6674333" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398739 1074 "The linearity property of the Laplace transform states that for functions $f(t)$ and $g(t),$ we have\n\n$$\nL{\\alpha f(t)+\\beta g(t)}=\\alpha \\cdot L{f(t)}+\\beta \\cdot L{g(t)}\n$$\n\nwhere $\\alpha $ and $\\beta $ are constants.\n\nTaking the Laplace transform and applying the linearity property, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{e}^{3t}-{e}^{-t}} & =L{{e}^{3t}}+L{-{e}^{-t}} \\\\  & =L{{e}^{3t}}-L{{e}^{-t}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we recall the following result:\n\n$$\nL{{e}^{kt}}=\\frac{1}{s-k},\\,s>k\n$$\n\n \nTherefore, we have the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{{e}^{3t}} & =\\frac{1}{s-3},\\,s>3 \\\\ L{{e}^{-t}} & =\\frac{1}{s+1},\\,s>-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the Laplace transform of $f(t)$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L{f(t)} & =L{{e}^{3t}}-L{{e}^{-t}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{s-3}-\\frac{1}{s+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{(s+1)-(s-3)}{(s-3)(s+1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{s+1-s+3}{(s-3)(s+1)} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{(s-3)(s+1)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, since $L{{e}^{3t}}$ is defined for $s\\in (3,\\infty )$ and $L{{e}^{-t}}$ is defined for $s\\in (-1,\\infty ),$ we have that $L{f(t)}$ is defined for\n\n$$\n(3,\\infty )\\cap (-1,\\infty )=(3,\\infty ),\n$$\n\nthat is, $s>3.$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398740 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398741 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398740 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398742 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398740 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398743 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398740 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398744 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398740 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398745 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398740 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398740 1077 "selection" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398740 1079 #edb/ref 17592186398745 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398740 1080 #uuid "1a417b69-1171-54da-bd75-777eee884877" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398741 1081 "\\frac{2s}{(s-3)(s+1)}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398741 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398741 1084 #uuid "32566370-0baa-5fb1-b7f3-81b3affe8868" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398742 1081 "\\frac{4}{(s-1)(s+3)}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398742 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398742 1084 #uuid "0716fd91-169b-5f0b-a6f5-08943732d486" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398743 1081 "-\\frac{4}{(s-3)(s+1)}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398743 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398743 1084 #uuid "24fd7005-9776-5c47-b5c3-2edac4af6f72" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398744 1081 "\\frac{s+1}{(s-3)(s+1)}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398744 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398744 1084 #uuid "47701396-f6b7-5c19-a7f4-3d458bef5ab4" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398745 1081 "\\frac{4}{(s-3)(s+1)}" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398745 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398745 1084 #uuid "da50ab10-42e1-5cd7-9d4f-7393d8b338d3" 131941395334