}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{9}{u}^{1/2}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{9}(1-9z)^{1/2}+C \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{9}\\sqrt{1-9z}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}z}[-\\frac{2}{9}\\sqrt{1-9z}+C] & =-\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}z}[\\sqrt{1-9z}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}z}(C) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}z}[(1-9z)^{1/2}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}z}(C) \\\\  & =-\\frac{2}{9}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}(1-9z)^{-1/2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}z}(1-9z)+0 \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{9}\\cdot (1-9z)^{-1/2}\\cdot (-9) \\\\  & =(1-9z)^{-1/2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-9z}}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398876 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398877 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398876 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398878 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398876 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398879 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398876 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398880 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398876 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398881 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398876 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398876 1077 "selection" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398876 1079 #edb/ref 17592186398879 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398876 1080 #uuid "f1f41607-89e1-5a62-888e-441db9b42ea9" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398877 1081 "-\\frac{2}{9}\\sqrt{(1-9z)^{3}}+C" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398877 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398877 1084 #uuid "739b7d37-465f-53a0-92fd-a46f218e891c" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398878 1081 "-2\\sqrt{1-9z}+C" 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [17592186398878 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533472 17592186045585 true] [175921863